1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:08,120
A demo agent can call tools, yet nothing checks that writes happened, that
notes stayed data, or that the budget held.

2
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:12,300
Offline workshop: fake model, fictional depot, no network.

3
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:18,380
The scripted assistant looks up a bin and reads a note: three model calls, two
reads.

4
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:23,800
Simulated cost zero point zero zero zero one two dollars, network none.

5
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:31,670
A tiny teaching server speaks JSON-RPC over standard input and output, with
two read tools.

6
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:35,860
Ask it to adjust stock: refused, the write tool is not exported.

7
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:39,460
A small subset, not the official MCP SDK.

8
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:44,030
The gate scores invariants, not a fixed tool order.

9
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:48,800
Six golden cases, zero failed; the two lookups use different tool orders.

10
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:53,340
The checker agrees with the author on five of six; one disagreement, shown.

11
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:58,380
The lab agent that obeys an injected note changes stock.

12
00:00:58,470 --> 00:01:01,590
The gate goes red, exit one, as expected.

13
00:01:02,930 --> 00:01:07,370
Learners start from failing exercises: module one, six failures.

14
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:10,140
Solutions pass, modules one to eight.

15
00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:16,790
Caveats. Not delivered; two sessions of three hours is [EST].

16
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:22,830
The model is a script: passing the gate means the synthetic cases passed, not
production readiness.

17
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:25,210
MCP here is a small subset.

18
00:01:26,390 --> 00:01:32,870
Deployment strategist angle: discovery first, not a model name. Shadow against
a cassette and the gate.

19
00:01:32,930 --> 00:01:40,300
Only then a live provider, behind the same gate. Not covered: real identity,
review queue, hosted runner.

20
00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:44,560
Labs cost zero vendor spend. Business figures are [EST].

